Modifications made by this project (the "covered work" is the whole repository):

  1. Only the Start button is pinned. Start menu, search flyout and task view
     repositioning code from upstream was removed; those windows are no longer
     hooked, and the mod loads into explorer.exe only.
  2. The Start button is pinned by hooking the native taskbar
     TaskbarCollapsibleLayout Arrange pass and removing the width it occupies
     from the centered icon group, instead of the upstream timer-driven
     Translation compensation.
  3. The Start button is identified by AutomationId=StartButton rather than by
     geometry heuristics.
  4. Right-click Start context menu anchoring is fixed locally, independently of
     Start menu placement.
  5. Nested layout state save/restore and an opt-in geometry diagnostics mode
     (disabled by default) were added.
  6. Taskbar transparency is not modified.

Modification date: 2026 (rewrite published as version 1.0.0).

